        "text": "This update for valkey fixes the following issues:\n\nUpdate to version 8.0.10.\n\n- CVE-2026-56684: RCE via CLIENT KILL due to use-after-free in TLS connection handling (bsc#1272443).\n- CVE-2026-63639: RCE via corrupt stream RDB files due to use-after-free when loading a stream consumer group from RDB\n  (bsc#1272442).\n",
